"Now enter your passphrase" = "Ahora introduce tu frase de contraseña";
"Your 12 or 24 words alone won't bring this account back. Enter the passphrase from what you wrote down, exactly, including capital letters and spaces." = "Tus 12 o 24 palabras solas no recuperarán esta cuenta. Introduce la frase de contraseña tal como la anotaste, exactamente, incluidas las mayúsculas y los espacios.";
"That doesn't match. Check your paper and try again." = "Eso no coincide. Revisa tu papel e inténtalo de nuevo.";
"Can't Complete This" = "No se puede completar";
"Your backup is good" = "Tu respaldo está bien";
"We'll check again in 6 months." = "Volveremos a comprobarlo en 6 meses.";
"Enter account name" = "Introduce el nombre de la cuenta";
"Your 12 or 24 words are ordinary words that work as the master key to your account. Your wallet, its addresses and your .kachat names all come from them." = "Tus 12 o 24 palabras son palabras corrientes que funcionan como la llave maestra de tu cuenta. Tu cartera, sus direcciones y tus nombres .kachat salen todos de ellas.";
"Anyone who has these words can take everything in your account. If you lose them and lose this device, nobody can get your account back, not even KaPlay." = "Cualquiera que tenga estas palabras puede llevarse todo lo de tu cuenta. Si las pierdes y pierdes este dispositivo, nadie podrá recuperar tu cuenta, ni siquiera KaPlay.";
"Restore from NFC Card" = "Restaurar desde tarjeta NFC";
"Choose 12 or 24 words" = "Elige 12 o 24 palabras";
"How many words are you importing?" = "¿Cuántas palabras vas a importar?";
"24 words" = "24 palabras";
