"Backup erased" = "Respaldo borrado";
"The backup and PIN are gone from this card. The next backup on it will ask you to set a new PIN." = "El respaldo y el PIN se borran de esta tarjeta. El próximo respaldo en ella te pedirá que fijes un PIN nuevo.";
"The backup is gone from this card. Its PIN stays the same." = "El respaldo se borra de esta tarjeta. Su PIN sigue igual.";
